{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2000001-0001-4001-8001-0000000000sii",
    "name": "SII Chile — Autenticación SOAP (semilla + token)",
    "description": "Prueba manual de autenticación SII (CrSeed + GetTokenFromSeed).\n\n## Importar\n1. Postman → Import → selecciona este archivo y el environment `SII-maullin.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Activa el environment **SII Certificación (maullin)**.\n\n## Request 1 — Semilla\nEjecuta **1. CrSeed — Obtener semilla**. Debe responder ESTADO 00 y guardar `sii_seed` en el environment.\n\n## Request 2 — Token (requiere firma con .pfx)\nPostman **no firma** certificados. Genera el body firmado con:\n\n```bash\ncd backend\nnpx tsx scripts/export-sii-curl-test.ts /ruta/certificado.pfx 'contraseña' certification\n```\n\nAbre `backend/tmp/sii-curl-test/2-get-token-request.xml`, copia **todo** el contenido y pégalo en:\n- Environment → variable `token_request_xml`, **o**\n- Body de la request 2 (reemplaza el placeholder).\n\n⚠️ La semilla vence en ~2 minutos. Ejecuta el script justo antes de la request 2.\n\n## Respuestas\n- ESTADO 00 + TOKEN → OK\n- ESTADO 10 → SII no creó token (certificado/permisos)\n- ESTADO 05/11/21 → problema de firma XML",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Certificación (maullin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. CrSeed — Obtener semilla",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.text();",
                  "const estadoMatch = body.match(/<ESTADO>(\\d+)<\\/ESTADO>/);",
                  "const semillaMatch = body.match(/<SEMILLA>(\\d+)<\\/SEMILLA>/);",
                  "if (estadoMatch) {",
                  "  pm.test('ESTADO semilla es 00', () => pm.expect(estadoMatch[1]).to.eql('00'));",
                  "  console.log('ESTADO:', estadoMatch[1]);",
                  "}",
                  "if (semillaMatch) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('sii_seed', semillaMatch[1]);",
                  "  console.log('SEMILLA guardada en sii_seed:', semillaMatch[1]);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.warn('No se encontró SEMILLA en la respuesta');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml; charset=utf-8"
              },
              {
                "key": "SOAPAction",
                "value": "\"\""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:xsd=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema\" xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:def=\"http://DefaultNamespace\">\n<soapenv:Header/>\n<soapenv:Body>\n<def:getSeed/>\n</soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "xml"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{sii_base_url}}/DTEWS/CrSeed.jws",
              "host": ["{{sii_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["DTEWS", "CrSeed.jws"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene semilla aleatoria del SII. Usar environment maullin o palena."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. GetTokenFromSeed — Obtener token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const xml = pm.environment.get('token_request_xml');",
                  "if (!xml || xml.trim().length < 100) {",
                  "  console.warn('Variable token_request_xml vacía. Ejecuta export-sii-curl-test.ts y pega 2-get-token-request.xml en el environment.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.text();",
                  "const estadoMatch = body.match(/<ESTADO>(\\d+)<\\/ESTADO>/);",
                  "const glosaMatch = body.match(/<GLOSA>([^<]*)<\\/GLOSA>/);",
                  "const tokenMatch = body.match(/<TOKEN>([^<]+)<\\/TOKEN>/);",
                  "if (estadoMatch) {",
                  "  console.log('ESTADO:', estadoMatch[1]);",
                  "  if (estadoMatch[1] === '00') {",
                  "    pm.test('Token creado (ESTADO 00)', () => true);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "if (glosaMatch) console.log('GLOSA:', glosaMatch[1]);",
                  "if (tokenMatch) console.log('TOKEN:', tokenMatch[1]);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml; charset=utf-8"
              },
              {
                "key": "SOAPAction",
                "value": "\"\""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{token_request_xml}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "xml"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{sii_base_url}}/DTEWS/GetTokenFromSeed.jws",
              "host": ["{{sii_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["DTEWS", "GetTokenFromSeed.jws"]
            },
            "description": "Envía semilla firmada con certificado .pfx.\n\n1. Ejecuta: npx tsx scripts/export-sii-curl-test.ts cert.pfx 'pass' certification\n2. Copia backend/tmp/sii-curl-test/2-get-token-request.xml\n3. Pégalo en Environment → token_request_xml\n4. Send (dentro de 2 min de generar el archivo)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Ambiente certificación: maullin.sii.cl — activar environment **SII Certificación (maullin)**"
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "sii_base_url",
      "value": "https://maullin.sii.cl"
    }
  ]
}
